Z||000010||Cliff Pennock||12-22-2001||04:58 AM||||Is the exact error message: "Unknown error: (87-FTPFileExist:InternetConnect)"?<P>If so, then there's something wrong in the profile you are using.<P>Click on "New" and in the "Automatic Configuration" field, type: <B>http://www.fiero.nl/fieroforum.pip</B> and click the "Get" button.<P>Let me know if that helped.<p>[This message has been edited by Cliff Pennock (edited 12-22-2001).]||||reg||1
